{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KlipVR brings you Shrimad Bhagavad Gita in VR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cExperience timeless wisdom in immersive reality\u2014anytime, anywhere.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In today\u2019s fast-paced world, many feel overwhelmed, disconnected, and spiritually fatigued. Ancient wisdom like the Bhagavad Gita often remains out of reach\u2014too abstract, too time-consuming, and not engaging enough for younger generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s why we created <strong>Shrimad Bhagavad Gita in Virtual Reality</strong>\u2014a fully immersive, interactive experience that brings the teachings of the Gita to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through the battlefield of Kurukshetra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Hear Krishna\u2019s guidance in your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Make choices as Arjuna and reflect on dharma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Meditate with verse-based guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a spiritual experience\u2014it\u2019s a journey of clarity, courage, and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Let Lord Krishna speak to your soul through immersive reality.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997040?t=1758694052","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997040/e300c653790aa44e68cf6536c2e476206976e70a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758694052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997040/d8cf6fdb519e0270a2868c8dba7db9a0b13611dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758694052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997040/d8cf6fdb519e0270a2868c8dba7db9a0b13611dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758694052","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KlipVR brings you Shrimad Bhagavad Gita in VR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cExperience timeless wisdom in immersive reality\u2014anytime, anywhere.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In today\u2019s fast-paced world, many feel overwhelmed, disconnected, and spiritually fatigued. Ancient wisdom like the Bhagavad Gita often remains out of reach\u2014too abstract, too time-consuming, and not engaging enough for younger generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s why we created <strong>Shrimad Bhagavad Gita in Virtual Reality</strong>\u2014a fully immersive, interactive experience that brings the teachings of the Gita to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through the battlefield of Kurukshetra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Hear Krishna\u2019s guidance in your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Make choices as Arjuna and reflect on dharma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Meditate with verse-based guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a spiritual experience\u2014it\u2019s a journey of clarity, courage, and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Let Lord Krishna speak to your soul through immersive reality.</p>","developers":["Klip VR Immersive Technologies Pvt Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997040/8c90bad7c34c696503a5fb77d06ed5f7f3660848/header.jpg?t=1758694052","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlig